Warning [jet.DivergentStatePaths]: `handle` ends in state `Joined` on one path and `Detached` on another.
  --> tests/ui_lint/task_state_diverges.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     if {
    |     ^^
 Why: Typestate: after two paths meet, a state holds only when both paths agree — here they do not, so from this point an operation that needs one of these states is rejected.
 Fix: Bring both paths to the same state before they meet, or do the work that needs the state inside the path that reaches it.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0152
